<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose three points to 1,372.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose three points to 1,372.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,372 today from 1,369 on July 16, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1459    13.244	  1451    13.171</p>
<p>   1a   1363 10325.000	  1363 10321.000</p>
<p>   2    1715    24.500	  1720    24.571</p>
<p>   2a   1637 13425.000	  1644 13486.000</p>
